`_hashish` with tainted:
```python
def _hashish(src, node, tainted):
    seg = _src(src, node)
    if HASHISH.search(seg) or re.search(r'\b[0-9a-f]{64}\b', seg):
        return True
    for sub in ast.walk(node):
        if isinstance(sub, ast.Name) and sub.id in tainted:
            return True
        if isinstance(sub, ast.Attribute) and sub.attr in tainted:
            return True
    return False
```

